NOTE ON SCOPE

The licence above covers the software in this repository: the application
code, its tests, and its documentation.

It does not purport to license the product data in `formulary_working/`.
Those CSV files hold nutrition values transcribed from Nestle Health Science
Canada and Abbott Nutrition Canada product documents, which carry their own
terms; see `formula_sources/SOURCES.md` for the source register. Individual
nutrition facts are not themselves copyrightable, but the compilation is not
the author's to sublicense, so it is excluded here rather than granted away
by omission. The manufacturer documents themselves are never committed to
this repository.

Anyone reusing the product data should verify it against the current
manufacturer documentation and their own institutional formulary, which is
what the application's own documentation asks of its clinical users.
